// hop-by-hop strip on the request leg: Keep-Alive and Connection removed upstream; two-sided
--- request
GET /strip/x HTTP/1.1
Host: front.example
Keep-Alive: timeout=5
Connection: close


--- reply
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 5
X-App: on

hello
--- expect-client
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Server: <normalized>
Date: <normalized>
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 5
Connection: close
X-App: on

hello
--- expect-backend
=== EXCHANGE ===
GET /x HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:@BPORT@

